function fPedidoOuOrcamentoEmAbertoParaClienteTodasAsEmpresas(strCodCli: String; Var stlPedidosAbertosTodasEmpresas: TStringList; strCodEmp: String = ''; strEspDoc: String = ''): Boolean;
  Var
    qryTemp: TUniQuery;
begin
  qryTemp := fCriaQuery(nil);

  Try
    qryTemp.Close;
    qryTemp.SQL.Clear;
    qryTemp.SQL.Add('SELECT ');
    qryTemp.SQL.Add('  FGO_NUMDOC, FGO_ESPDOC, FGO_CODEMP ');
    qryTemp.SQL.Add('FROM');
    qryTemp.SQL.Add('  FATGOR');
    qryTemp.SQL.Add('WHERE');
    qryTemp.SQL.Add('  FGO_CODCLI = :CODCLI AND');
    qryTemp.SQL.Add('  FGO_JAFATU = 0       AND');
    qryTemp.SQL.Add('  FGO_ESPDOC <> "PR"      ');

    If (Not strCodEmp.IsEmpty) Then
      qryTemp.SQL.Add(' AND FGO_CODEMP = :CODEMP ');

    If (Not strEspDoc.IsEmpty) Then
      qryTemp.SQL.Add(' AND FGO_ESPDOC = :ESPDOC ');

    qryTemp.SQL.Add('ORDER BY');
    qryTemp.SQL.Add('  FGO_NUMDOC');

    qryTemp.ParamByName('CODCLI').AsString := strCodCli;

    If qryTemp.FindParam('CODEMP') <> Nil Then
       qryTemp.ParamByName('CODEMP').AsString := strCodEmp;

    If (qryTemp.FindParam('ESPDOC')) <> Nil Then
       qryTemp.ParamByName('ESPDOC').AsString := strEspDoc;

    qryTemp.Open;

    Result := Not qryTemp.IsEmpty;

    stlPedidosAbertosTodasEmpresas.Clear;
    qryTemp.First;
    While Not qryTemp.EOF Do
    Begin
      stlPedidosAbertosTodasEmpresas.Add(qryTemp.FieldByName('FGO_NUMDOC').AsString+'-'+
                                         qryTemp.FieldByName('FGO_ESPDOC').AsString+'-'+
                                         qryTemp.FieldByName('FGO_CODEMP').AsString);
      qryTemp.Next;
    End;

  Finally
    FreeAndNil(qryTemp);
  End;
end;

function fGetSqlDtaVenctoOriginal():String;
var
  strResult :string;
begin
    strResult := '';
    strResult := strResult + ' IFNULL( '+
                                     ' (SELECT CTR_DTAVEN FROM LOGCTR L '+
                                     '   WHERE '+ //-- L.CTR_DESCRI = 'INCLUSÃO' AND
                                     '         L.CTR_NUMDUP = CADREC.CTR_NUMDUP AND '+
                                     '         L.CTR_ESPDOC = CADREC.CTR_ESPDOC AND '+
                                     '         L.CTR_PARCEL = CADREC.CTR_PARCEL AND '+
                                     '         L.CTR_CODEMP = CADREC.CTR_CODEMP AND '+
                                     '         L.CTR_CODCLI = CADREC.CTR_CODCLI AND '+
                                     '         L.CTR_SEQBAI = 0 '+
                                     '   GROUP BY CTR_NUMDUP, CTR_ESPDOC, CTR_PARCEL, CTR_CODEMP, CTR_CODCLI '+
                                     '   ORDER BY CTR_DTALOG, CTR_HORLOG), CADREC.CTR_DTAVEN) AS CTR_DTAVEN  ';

    result := strResult;
end;

function fSQLMedAtraso(strRedLoj: String; blnRedLoj: Boolean): String;
  Var
    strSQL: String;
begin

  strSQL := ' SELECT ';

  If (fCfgSis('CVOREF') = 'S') Then
     strSQL := strSQL + fGetSqlDtaVenctoOriginal()
  Else
     strSQL := strSQL + ' CTR_DTAVEN ';

  strSQL := strSQL + '   ,CTR_DTAREC                '+
                     ' FROM CADREC                  '+
                     ' INNER JOIN CADCLI            '+
                     '   ON CLI_CODCLI = CTR_CODCLI '+
                     ' WHERE (                      ';

  If (Not fEmptyStr(strRedLoj)) And (blnRedLoj) Then
  Begin
    strSQL := strSQL + '  CLI_CODRED = :REDE        ';
  End
  Else
  Begin
    strSQL := strSQL + '   CLI_CODCLI = :CODCLI       ';

    If (fCfgSis('TRFTCR', varString) = '2') And (blnRedLoj) Then
    Begin
      strSQL := strSQL + ' OR CLI_CODRED =              '+
                         ' (SELECT                      '+
                         '    CLI_CODRED                '+
                         '  FROM                        '+
                         '    CADCLI                    '+
                         '  WHERE CLI_CODCLI = :CODCLI) ';
    End;
  End;

  strSQL := strSQL + ' )                            ';

  If fCfgSis('EMREFN') = '1' Then
    strSQL := strSQL + ' AND CTR_CODEMP IN (' + fRetStrToSQLIn(strEmpAcessoUsuarioLogado) + ') ';

  strSQL := strSQL + '   AND CTR_DTAREC > CTR_DTAVEN   '+
                     '   AND CTR_VALORI > 0            '+
                     ' GROUP BY CTR_DTAVEN, CTR_DTAREC '+
                     ' ORDER BY CTR_DTAVEN             ';

  Result := strSQL;
end;

function fBuscaMediaDeAtraso(strCodCli: String; strRedLoj: String = ''; blnRedLoj: Boolean = False;
  blnAjustaData: Boolean = False): Double;
  Var
    qryAuxDta    : TUniQuery;
    fltContDias  : Double;
    fltMedAtraso : Double;
    dtaDtaVen    : TDateTime;
    dtaDtaBase   : TDateTime;
begin
  qryAuxDta := fCriaQuery;

  Try
    qryAuxDta.Close;
    qryAuxDta.SQL.Clear;
    qryAuxDta.SQL.Add(fSQLMedAtraso(strRedLoj, blnRedLoj));

    If (Not fEmptyStr(strRedLoj)) And (blnRedLoj) Then
      qryAuxDta.ParamByName('REDE').AsString   := strRedLoj
    Else
      qryAuxDta.ParamByName('CODCLI').AsString := strCodCli;

    qryAuxDta.Open;

    fltContDias := 0;

    While (Not qryAuxDta.Eof) Do
    Begin
      dtaDtaVen  := qryAuxDta.FieldByName('CTR_DTAVEN').AsDateTime;

      If (qryAuxDta.FieldByName('CTR_DTAREC').IsNull) Then
        dtaDtaBase := Date
      Else
        dtaDtaBase := qryAuxDta.FieldByName('CTR_DTAREC').AsDateTime;

      If (blnAjustaData) Then
        fltContDias := fltContDias + (dtaDtaBase - fBuscaProxDiaUtil(dtaDtaVen, VS_strCodEmp).dtaProximoDiaUtil)
      Else
        fltContDias := fltContDias + (dtaDtaBase - dtaDtaVen);

      qryAuxDta.Next;
    End;

    If (Not qryAuxDta.IsEmpty) Then
      fltMedAtraso := fltContDias / qryAuxDta.RecordCount
    Else
      fltMedAtraso := 0;

    Result := fltMedAtraso;
  Finally
    FreeAndNil(qryAuxDta);
  End;
end;

function fRetSQLAcumulados(strRedLoj: String; blnRedLoj: Boolean; blnResFin: Boolean): String;
  Var
    strSQL: String;
begin
  strSQL := 'SELECT                                         '+
            '  IFNULL(                                      '+
            '    SUM(                                       '+
            '      IF(                                      '+
            '        LEFT(DET_CLAFIS, 1) >= 5,              '+
            '        DET_TOTITE - DET_DESESP - DET_DESCFF,  '+
            '        - (                                    '+
            '          DET_TOTITE - DET_DESESP - DET_DESCFF '+
            '        )                                      '+
            '      )                                        '+
            '    ),                                         '+
            '    0                                          '+
            '  ) AS ACUMUL                                  '+
            'FROM                                           '+
            '  MOVDET                                       '+
            '  INNER JOIN CADCLI                            '+
            '    ON CLI_CODCLI = DET_CODCLI                 '+
            'WHERE (                                        ';

  If (Not fEmptyStr(strRedLoj)) And (blnRedLoj) Then
  Begin
    strSQL := strSQL + '  CLI_CODRED = :REDE ';
  End
  Else
  Begin
    strSQL := strSQL + '  CLI_CODCLI = :CODCLI ';

    If (fCfgSis('TRFTCR', varString) = '2') And (blnRedLoj) Then
      strSQL := strSQL + '    OR CLI_CODRED =                              '+
                         '    (SELECT                                      '+
                         '       CLI_CODRED                                '+
                         '     FROM                                        '+
                         '       CADCLI                                    '+
                         '     WHERE CLI_CODCLI = :CODCLI)                 ';

  End;

  strSQL := strSQL + '  )                                            '+
                     '  AND DET_TIP_FC = "C"                         '+
                     '  AND DET_PROEMB <> "S"                        ';

  If (blnResFin) And (fCfgSis('EMREFN', varString) = '1') Then
    strSQL := strSQL + '  AND DET_CODEMP IN (' + fRetStrToSQLIn(strEmpAcessoUsuarioLogado) + ') ';

  strSQL := strSQL + '  AND DET_DTAENT >= :DTAACU                    '+
                     '  AND (                                        '+
                     '    (LOCATE(DET_CLAFIS, :CLAVEN) > 0)          '+
                     '    OR (LOCATE(DET_CLAFIS, :CLADEV) > 0)       ';

  If (fCfgSis('ENTBRF', varBoolean)) Then
  Begin
    strSQL := strSQL + '    OR (DET_ESPDOC = "BR")                     '+
                       '    OR LOCATE(DET_CLAFIS, ' + CLAFIS_BR + ')   ';
  End;

  strSQL := strSQL + '  )                                            ';

  Result := strSQL;
end;

function fRetValorAcumuladoNoPeriodo(strCodCli: String; dtaInicio: TDateTime;
  strRedLoj: String = ''; blnRedLoj: Boolean = False; blnResFin: Boolean = False): Double;
  Var
    qryDados: TUniQuery;
begin
  Result := 0;
  qryDados := fCriaQuery;

  Try
    qryDados.Close;
    qryDados.SQL.Clear;
    qryDados.SQL.Text := fRetSQLAcumulados(strRedLoj, blnRedLoj, blnResFin);

    If (qryDados.FindParam('REDE') <> Nil) Then
      qryDados.ParamByName('REDE').AsString := strRedLoj;

    If (qryDados.FindParam('CODCLI') <> Nil) Then
      qryDados.ParamByName('CODCLI').AsString := strCodCli;

    qryDados.ParamByName('CLAVEN').AsString := VS_strClaVen;
    qryDados.ParamByName('CLADEV').AsString := VS_strClaDev;
    qryDados.ParamByName('DTAACU').AsDate   := dtaInicio;
    qryDados.Open;

    If (qryDados.IsEmpty) Then
      Exit;

    Result := qryDados.FieldByName('ACUMUL').AsFloat;
  Finally
    FreeAndNil(qryDados);
  End;
end;

function fFormatarLatLon(const strLatLon : String) : String;
  Var
    intCnt : Integer;
    strChar : String;
begin
  Result := '';
  For intCnt := 1 To Length(strLatLon) Do
  Begin
    strChar := strLatLon[intCnt];
    If (strChar = ',') Then
    Begin
      If (intCnt > 1) And
         (fIsNumber(strLatLon[intCnt-1])) And
         ((intCnt+1) <= Length(strLatLon)) And
         (fIsNumber(strLatLon[intCnt+1])) Then
      Begin
        strChar := '.'
      End;
    End;
    Result := Result + strChar;
  End;
end;

procedure pExtrairCoordenadas(const strLatLon : String; out strLatitude, strLongitude : String);
  Var
    lstCoordenadas : TStringList;
begin
  lstCoordenadas := TStringList.Create;
  Try
    strLatitude := '';
    strLongitude := '';

    lstCoordenadas.Delimiter := ',';
    lstCoordenadas.StrictDelimiter := True;
    lstCoordenadas.DelimitedText := fFormatarLatLon(strLatLon);

    If (lstCoordenadas.Count = 2) Then
    Begin
      strLatitude := lstCoordenadas[0];
      strLongitude := lstCoordenadas[1];
    End;
  Finally
    FreeAndNil(lstCoordenadas);
  End;
end;

function fDistanciaEntreCoordenadas(ACoordenada,
  BCoordenada: String): Double;
Var
  lstCoordenadas: TStringList;
  CoordA,
  CoordB : TTMSFNCMapsCoordinateRec;
begin
  lstCoordenadas                 := TStringList.Create;
  lstCoordenadas.Delimiter       := ',';
  lstCoordenadas.StrictDelimiter := True;

  {*************************}
  {* CONVERTE COORDENADA A *}
  {*************************}
  lstCoordenadas.DelimitedText := ACoordenada;

  CoordA.Latitude  := StrToFloat(ReplaceStr(lstCoordenadas[0],'.',','));
  CoordA.Longitude := StrToFloat(ReplaceStr(lstCoordenadas[1],'.',','));

  {*************************}
  {* CONVERTE COORDENADA B *}
  {*************************}
  lstCoordenadas.DelimitedText := BCoordenada;

  CoordB.Latitude  := StrToFloat(ReplaceStr(lstCoordenadas[0],'.',','));
  CoordB.Longitude := StrToFloat(ReplaceStr(lstCoordenadas[1],'.',','));

  Result := MeasureDistance(CoordA, CoordB);
end;

